{"title": "Running Jump", "pageid": 28948, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Running_Jump", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Running Jump</b> is a passive feature that lets the user jump for free after they dash.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per turn, after the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dashes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dashes</a> or takes a similar action, they can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/38px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/50px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/25px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\">Jump</a> without using a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/80px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump (Running)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\">Jump (Running)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fleetfingers\" title=\"Fleetfingers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Fleetfingers_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fleetfingers\" title=\"Fleetfingers\">Fleetfingers</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Running Jump requires the wearer to be in combat to activate.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to a conditional requirement check bug, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump_(Running)\" title=\"Jump (Running)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/20px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Jump_Running_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Running_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump 